            <title>1.6.1</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 01:10:25 +0700</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[<html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><style>:root{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.45 -apple-system,system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0 4px}h2{font-size:20px;margin:6px 0 4px}h3{font-size:13px;margin:16px 0 4px}p{margin:4px 0}.date{opacity:.6}ul{margin:4px 0;padding-left:20px}li{margin:4px 0}code{font:12px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace}</style></head><body><h2>1.6.1</h2><p class="date">Release date: 24 Sep 2026</p><h3>New in 1.6.1</h3><ul><li>Watch it run – while a skill, agent or tool is working, its token count ticks up live and pulses softly.</li><li>Fixed high CPU use while the popup stayed open.</li><li>A second click on an agent now closes its details.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
